// Climb to the top of a wall and roll smoothly over the edge: no teleport pop, no hop on arrival, and it
// works holding only W (up) as well as holding toward the wall.
map
##########################
#........................#
#........................#
#........................#
#........................#
#...............##########
#...............##########
#...............##########
#...............##########
#...............##########
#...............##########
#...............##########
#...............##########
#..@............##########
##########################
end
hold 1-60 right
hold 55-60 right jump
hold 61-66 right up
hold 67-120 up
